Error: enterprise-federation certified posture (3x7 ruling §5.3, docs/audit/3x7-v1-cutline-ruling-2026-08-01.md) refuses to boot — 1 required control(s) missing or below floor:
  - AI_MEMORY_ENCRYPT_AT_REST: required "1, on a binary built with --features sqlcipher", actual "env=1 sqlcipher_build=false". Fix: rebuild with --features sqlcipher AND set AI_MEMORY_ENCRYPT_AT_REST=1
Fix the control(s) above, then re-check with `ai-memory doctor --posture enterprise-federation` — the diagnostic bypasses this boot gate (#3003) so it renders the full report even while the gate is armed, and exits 0 once every control passes (2 while any fails). To boot WITHOUT this cert gate instead, unset AI_MEMORY_REQUIRE_ENTERPRISE_FEDERATION_POSTURE.
